Hi,

I am getting the same error

inla.mkl: smtp-pardiso.c:757: GMRFLib_pardiso_solve_core: Assertion `store->pstore->done_with_chol == GMRFLib_TRUE' failed

when running a mixed effects model.
I am doubting that my RAM is the issue, as I am running on a computational cluster with a large amount of memory (~120Gb) and I am using the options you recommended above
control.inla=list(strategy="adaptive", int.strategy="eb"), with the latest stable version of INLA.
This error does happen not reliably, but more than half the time (even when I change nothing in the code/input data).
Any ideas for a solution?

Best regards,
Kenneth

